{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "G-MODE\u30a2\u30fc\u30ab\u30a4\u30d6\u30b922 \u30d8\u30e9\u30af\u30ec\u30b9\u306e\u6804\u5149\u2162 \u795e\u3005\u306e\u6c88\u9ed9",
    "steam_appid": 3561420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A heartfelt masterpiece RPG woven by gods and humans\u2014<br>The series' most captivating story is revived in G-MODE Archives!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Greek mythology, &quot;Glory of Heracles&quot; is a legendary RPG series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the release of the first game, T\u014djin Maky\u014d-den: Heracles no Eik\u014d, in 1987, this beloved RPG series has told countless stories across multiple platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the series, this title is especially renowned for having the best storyline of them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3010Game System\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a command-based RPG system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the world shifts between day and night, affecting the characters you meet and the shops available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seven distinct weapon types and powerful magic learned from temples, players must overcome formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For weaker enemies, the Auto-Battle Mode allows characters to fight automatically using basic attacks, making battles smoother and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3010Story\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is Ancient Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, peace has reigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotions like suffering and sorrow have long faded, buried deep within the memories of past generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods of the heavens, watching over this tranquil paradise, took great satisfaction in seeing the world they created flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, even in such an era, there was one god who never took his eyes off the human realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That god was Zeus, the supreme ruler of Olympus and the great creator of all things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his ever-watchful gaze, Zeus observed the world below, missing no detail\u2014no matter how small.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And soon, he began to notice something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subtle yet undeniable shift in the peaceful paradise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561420/extras/b134475b2884180df775752adee1b204.avif?t=1743564402\" width=800 height=671 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A heartfelt masterpiece RPG woven by gods and humans\u2014<br>The series' most captivating story is revived in G-MODE Archives!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Greek mythology, &quot;Glory of Heracles&quot; is a legendary RPG series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the release of the first game, T\u014djin Maky\u014d-den: Heracles no Eik\u014d, in 1987, this beloved RPG series has told countless stories across multiple platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the series, this title is especially renowned for having the best storyline of them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3010Game System\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a command-based RPG system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the world shifts between day and night, affecting the characters you meet and the shops available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seven distinct weapon types and powerful magic learned from temples, players must overcome formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For weaker enemies, the Auto-Battle Mode allows characters to fight automatically using basic attacks, making battles smoother and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u3010Story\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is Ancient Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, peace has reigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotions like suffering and sorrow have long faded, buried deep within the memories of past generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods of the heavens, watching over this tranquil paradise, took great satisfaction in seeing the world they created flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, even in such an era, there was one god who never took his eyes off the human realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That god was Zeus, the supreme ruler of Olympus and the great creator of all things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his ever-watchful gaze, Zeus observed the world below, missing no detail\u2014no matter how small.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And soon, he began to notice something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subtle yet undeniable shift in the peaceful paradise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561420/extras/b134475b2884180df775752adee1b204.avif?t=1743564402\" width=800 height=671 /></span></p>",
